{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12702","headline":"引东泉作 · 元结","name":"引东泉作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东泉人未知，在我左山东。\n引之傍山来，垂流落庭中。\n宿雾含朝光，掩映如残虹。\n有时散成雨，飘洒随清风。\n衆源发渊窦，殊怪皆不同。\n此流又高悬，{汸番}{汸番}在长空。\n山林何处无，兹地不可逢。\n吾欲解缨佩，便爲泉上翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12702.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12702","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}